  "details": "<p>According to L. Lerat writing in <em><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Perseus%3Atext%3A1999.04.0006%3Aalphabetic+letter%3DC%3Aentry+group%3D9%3Aentry%3Dcorre\" target=\"_self\" title=\"PECS (Perseus) CORRE Haute-Sa\u00f4ne, France\">PECS</a></em>, a number of fine sculptures were discovered at the site. They are displayed in the museum at Vesoul.</p>",
